<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ms">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Modul Interaktif Fizik SPM: Tekanan (Rajah Asal 100%)</title>
  <!-- Tailwind CSS -->
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <!-- Font Awesome -->
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
  <!-- PDF.js for 100% Original Unmodified Image Extraction from TEKANAN.pdf -->
  <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/pdf.js/3.11.174/pdf.min.js"></script>
  <!-- Google Fonts Inter -->
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

  <script>
    tailwind.config = {
      darkMode: 'class',
      theme: {
        extend: {
          fontFamily: {
            sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],
            mono: ['JetBrains Mono', 'monospace'],
          }
        }
      }
    }
  </script>

  <style>
    ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 6px; height: 6px; }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: #f1f5f9; }
    .dark ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: #1e293b; }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #cbd5e1; border-radius: 4px; }
    .dark ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #475569; }
    .transition-all-custom { transition: all 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1); }
    .original-img-frame {
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
    }
    .dark .original-img-frame {
      background: #ffffff; /* Keep paper background white so original black-and-white scan is 100% unaltered */
      border: 2px solid #475569;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-950 text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 min-h-screen flex flex-col font-sans transition-colors duration-200"
      ondragover="handleDragOver(event)" ondrop="handleDrop(event)">

  <!-- Hidden File Input for TEKANAN.pdf -->
  <input type="file" id="pdfFileInput" accept="application/pdf" class="hidden" onchange="handlePdfFileSelect(event)">
  <!-- Hidden File Input for Single Question Direct Image Upload -->
  <input type="file" id="singleImageInput" accept="image/*" class="hidden" onchange="handleSingleImageUpload(event)">

  <!-- Top Navigation Header -->
  <header class="sticky top-0 z-40 bg-white/95 dark:bg-slate-900/95 backdrop-blur border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 h-16 flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
      
      <!-- Logo / Title -->
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-blue-700 flex items-center justify-center text-white shadow">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-file-pdf text-xl"></i>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h1 class="text-sm sm:text-base font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
            Soalan Interaktif Fizik: TEKANAN
            <span class="text-[11px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-emerald-100 dark:bg-emerald-900/60 text-emerald-800 dark:text-emerald-300 font-semibold border border-emerald-300 dark:border-emerald-700">100% Rajah Asal</span>
          </h1>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">40 Soalan Dwibahasa MRSM — Tanpa Lukisan Semula (Original Scan)</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Controls -->
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 sm:gap-2.5 flex-wrap justify-end">
        <!-- Exam Timer -->
        <div id="examTimerBadge" class="hidden items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-950/60 border border-amber-300 dark:border-amber-700 text-amber-800 dark:text-amber-300 text-xs sm:text-sm font-mono font-bold">
          <i class="fa-regular fa-clock animate-pulse"></i>
          <span id="timerDisplay">60:00</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Upload PDF Button -->
        <button onclick="document.getElementById('pdfFileInput').click()" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white text-xs font-bold shadow-sm transition flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-file-arrow-up"></i>
          <span class="hidden sm:inline">Muat Naik</span> TEKANAN.pdf
        </button>

        <!-- Export Standalone HTML Button -->
        <button id="btnExportHtml" onclick="exportStandaloneHTML()" class="hidden px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white text-xs font-bold shadow-sm transition items-center gap-1.5" title="Muat turun fail HTML tunggal yang mengandungi semua imej asal terbenam">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-download"></i>
          <span class="hidden md:inline">Eksport HTML Lengkap</span>
        </button>

        <!-- Mode Toggle -->
        <div class="flex items-center bg-slate-200/80 dark:bg-slate-800 p-1 rounded-xl text-xs font-semibold">
          <button id="btnPracticeMode" onclick="setQuizMode('practice')" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-slate-700 text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300 shadow-sm transition">
            Latihan
          </button>
          <button id="btnExamMode" onclick="setQuizMode('exam')" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 hover:text-slate-900 transition">
            Ujian
          </button>
        </div>

        <!-- Formula Sheet Modal Toggle -->
        <button onclick="toggleFormulaModal()" class="px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-800 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200" title="Senarai Rumus">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-square-root-variable text-blue-600"></i>
        </button>

        <!-- Dark Mode Toggle -->
        <button onclick="toggleDarkMode()" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 flex items-center justify-center text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-800">
          <i id="themeIcon" class="fa-solid fa-moon text-sm"></i>
        </button>
      </div>

    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Banner for Loading Original TEKANAN.pdf Images -->
  <div id="pdfExtractorBanner" class="hidden bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-950/50 border-b border-blue-200 dark:border-blue-800/80 py-3 px-4 transition-all">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-3">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-blue-950 dark:text-blue-200">
        <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-blue-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-camera-retro"></i>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="font-bold block" id="bannerTitleText">Paparan Rajah Asal Tanpa Sebarang Lukisan Semula (100% Original PDF Scan)</span>
          <span class="text-xs text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300" id="bannerSubText">Pilih atau seret fail <b>TEKANAN.pdf</b> anda ke sini untuk mengekstrak automatik kesemua 35 rajah asal terus daripada dokumen PDF tanpa diubah suai.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 shrink-0">
        <button onclick="document.getElementById('pdfFileInput').click()" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white text-xs font-bold shadow transition whitespace-nowrap">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-folder-open mr-1.5"></i> Pilih Fail TEKANAN.pdf
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <!-- Extraction Progress Bar -->
    <div id="extractionProgressWrap" class="hidden max-w-7xl mx-auto mt-2.5">
      <div class="w-full bg-blue-200 dark:bg-blue-900 h-2 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
        <div id="extractionProgressBar" class="bg-blue-600 h-full transition-all duration-150" style="width: 0%"></div>
      </div>
      <p id="extractionStatusText" class="text-[11px] font-mono text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-300 mt-1 text-center">Mengekstrak rajah asal...</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Student Identity Bar (Nama, No Maktab, MRSM as on Page 1 of TEKANAN.pdf) -->
  <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 py-2.5">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 text-xs">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 flex-1">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <label class="font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase">NAMA:</label>
          <input type="text" id="studentName" oninput="saveStudentInfo()" placeholder="Nama Pelajar..." class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100 font-semibold focus:outline-none focus:border-blue-500 w-40 sm:w-52">
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <label class="font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase">NO. MAKTAB:</label>
          <input type="text" id="studentID" oninput="saveStudentInfo()" placeholder="Contoh: 24001" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100 font-mono font-semibold focus:outline-none focus:border-blue-500 w-28 sm:w-32">
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <label class="font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase">MRSM:</label>
          <input type="text" id="studentMRSM" oninput="saveStudentInfo()" placeholder="Cawangan MRSM..." class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100 font-semibold focus:outline-none focus:border-blue-500 w-32 sm:w-40">
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Topic Filter Pills -->
      <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 overflow-x-auto">
        <button onclick="filterByTopic('ALL')" id="tabTopicALL" class="topic-tab-btn px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-900 text-white dark:bg-blue-600 font-semibold whitespace-nowrap">Semua (40)</button>
        <button onclick="filterByTopic('Tekanan Cecair')" id="tabTopic1" class="topic-tab-btn px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-200 whitespace-nowrap">Cecair</button>
        <button onclick="filterByTopic('Tekanan Gas & Atmosfera')" id="tabTopic2" class="topic-tab-btn px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-200 whitespace-nowrap">Gas & Atm</button>
        <button onclick="filterByTopic('Prinsip Pascal')" id="tabTopic3" class="topic-tab-btn px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-200 whitespace-nowrap">Pascal</button>
        <button onclick="filterByTopic('Prinsip Archimedes')" id="tabTopic4" class="topic-tab-btn px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-200 whitespace-nowrap">Archimedes</button>
        <button onclick="filterByTopic('Prinsip Bernoulli')" id="tabTopic5" class="topic-tab-btn px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-200 whitespace-nowrap">Bernoulli</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Main Content -->
  <main class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-5 flex-1 w-full flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-5">

    <!-- Left Column: Question Card -->
    <div class="flex-1 flex flex-col gap-4">

      <!-- Question Status Header -->
      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-2xl p-4 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 dark:bg-blue-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm shadow" id="badgeCurrentQNum">1</span>
          <div>
            <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider block" id="currentRajahNumber">HALAMAN 1 • RAJAH 20</span>
            <span class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100" id="currentCategoryTitle">Tekanan Cecair</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 sm:gap-3">
          <!-- Bookmark Button -->
          <button onclick="toggleBookmarkCurrent()" id="btnBookmark" class="p-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 text-slate-400 hover:text-amber-500 transition text-xs flex items-center gap-1.5 font-semibold">
            <i class="fa-regular fa-bookmark"></i> Simpan
          </button>
          <!-- Progress Indicator -->
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <div class="w-24 sm:w-32 bg-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-700 h-2 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
              <div id="progressBar" class="bg-blue-600 h-full rounded-full transition-all duration-300" style="width: 2.5%;"></div>
            </div>
            <span id="progressText" class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">1/40</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Main Question Body -->
      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm overflow-hidden flex flex-col">
        
        <div class="p-5 sm:p-7 flex flex-col gap-5">
          
          <!-- Original Diagram Container (Strictly Original Image Only - NO Redrawn SVG) -->
          <div id="diagramWrapper" class="w-full flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-4 rounded-xl original-img-frame relative">
            
            <!-- Toolbar on top-right of diagram box -->
            <div class="w-full flex items-center justify-between mb-2 pb-2 border-b border-slate-200 text-[11px] text-slate-500">
              <span id="diagramSourceLabel" class="font-mono font-semibold text-slate-600">
                <i class="fa-regular fa-image mr-1"></i> Rajah Asal TEKANAN.pdf
              </span>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <button id="btnOpenCropModal" onclick="openCropAdjusterModal()" class="hidden px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 font-semibold transition" title="Laraskan kawasan keratan terus daripada halaman PDF asal">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-crop-simple mr-1"></i> Laras Keratan PDF Asal
                </button>
                <button id="btnToggleFullPage" onclick="toggleFullPdfPageView()" class="hidden px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 font-semibold transition" title="Papar halaman penuh PDF asal">
                  <i class="fa-regular fa-file-lines mr-1"></i> Halaman Penuh
                </button>
                <button onclick="triggerDirectImageUpload()" class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 font-semibold transition" title="Muat naik atau tampal (Ctrl+V) imej asal bagi soalan ini">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-upload mr-1"></i> Ganti Imej
                </button>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Actual Original Image Element -->
            <div id="diagramContainer" class="w-full flex flex-col justify-center items-center min-h-[160px]">
              <img id="originalQuestionImg" src="" alt="Rajah Asal Soalan" class="hidden max-w-full max-h-[380px] object-contain mx-auto select-none" />
              
              <!-- Shown only before TEKANAN.pdf is loaded -->
              <div id="unloadedDiagramPlaceholder" class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center p-6 max-w-md mx-auto gap-3">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 flex items-center justify-center text-xl border border-slate-300">
                  <i class="fa-regular fa-file-pdf"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="space-y-1">
                  <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-slate-800" id="placeholderTitle">Rajah Asal daripada TEKANAN.pdf</p>
                  <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Tiada lukisan semula dilakukan. Klik butang di bawah untuk memuat naik fail <b>TEKANAN.pdf</b> dan memaparkan imej asal 100% bagi kesemua 40 soalan.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-2 pt-1">
                  <button onclick="document.getElementById('pdfFileInput').click()" class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white text-xs font-bold shadow-sm transition">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-file-pdf mr-1.5"></i> Muat Naik TEKANAN.pdf
                  </button>
                  <button onclick="triggerDirectImageUpload()" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-300 text-slate-800 text-xs font-semibold transition">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-paste mr-1"></i> Pilih / Tampal Imej (Ctrl+V)
                  </button>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>

          <!-- Question Text BM & BI -->
          <div class="space-y-2.5">
            <div id="qTextBM" class="text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white leading-relaxed">
              ...
            </div>
            <div id="qTextBI" class="text-xs sm:text-sm italic text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed border-l-2 border-blue-400 dark:border-blue-600 pl-3">
              ...
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Options List (A, B, C, D) -->
          <div id="optionsList" class="flex flex-col gap-2.5 pt-1">
            <!-- Dynamic Option Buttons -->
          </div>

          <!-- Detailed Explanation Box -->
          <div id="explanationContainer" class="hidden flex-col gap-3 p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-xl border transition-all">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span id="explanationBadge" class="px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-bold rounded-md flex items-center gap-1.5"></span>
              <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400">Skema Jawapan & Jalan Pengiraan</span>
            </div>
            <div id="explanationContent" class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 space-y-2 leading-relaxed"></div>
          </div>

        </div>

        <!-- Footer Navigation Bar -->
        <div class="bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900/80 px-5 sm:px-7 py-3.5 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <button id="btnPrev" onclick="navigateQuestion(-1)" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-700 transition disabled:opacity-40">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left mr-1.5"></i> Sebelum
            </button>
            <button id="btnNext" onclick="navigateQuestion(1)" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-700 transition disabled:opacity-40">
              Seterusnya <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right ml-1.5"></i>
            </button>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <button id="btnCheckAnswer" onclick="checkCurrentAnswer()" class="px-5 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white shadow-sm transition">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-check-double mr-1.5"></i> Semak Jawapan
            </button>
            <button id="btnFinishExam" onclick="confirmSubmitExam()" class="hidden px-5 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white shadow-sm transition">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-file-export mr-1.5"></i> Hantar Ujian
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Right Column: Question Palette & Topic Progress -->
    <div class="w-full lg:w-80 flex flex-col gap-4">

      <!-- Question Navigator Palette -->
      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-5 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm flex flex-col gap-3">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
          <h3 class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-table-cells text-blue-600"></i> Navigasi Soalan (1 - 40)
          </h3>
          <span id="filteredIndicator" class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-medium">Semua (40)</span>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-5 sm:grid-cols-8 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-2 max-h-72 overflow-y-auto pr-1" id="paletteGrid">
          <!-- 40 buttons -->
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center justify-between pt-2 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 text-xs">
          <button onclick="openResetConfirmModal()" class="text-rose-500 hover:text-rose-600 font-semibold">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-rotate-left mr-1"></i> Reset Jawapan
          </button>
          <span class="text-slate-400 font-mono text-[11px]" id="statSummaryCompact">0/40 Dijawab</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Subtopic Breakdown -->
      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-5 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm flex flex-col gap-3 text-xs">
        <h3 class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group text-emerald-500"></i> Pecahan Topik Bab Tekanan
        </h3>
        <div class="space-y-2" id="topicProgressBarContainer"></div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </main>

  <!-- Interactive Original PDF Crop Adjuster Modal (Strictly crops original PDF page pixels without redrawing) -->
  <div id="cropAdjusterModal" class="hidden fixed inset-0 z-50 bg-black/75 backdrop-blur-sm flex items-center justify-center p-4">
    <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 max-w-3xl w-full rounded-2xl p-5 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-2xl flex flex-col gap-4 max-h-[92vh] overflow-hidden">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b pb-3 dark:border-slate-800">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-crop-simple text-blue-600"></i> Pilih Kawasan Keratan Rajah Asal PDF
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Seret tetikus pada halaman PDF asal di bawah untuk menetapkan keratan imej asal bagi soalan ini.</p>
        </div>
        <button onclick="closeCropAdjusterModal()" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-600 dark:hover:text-white">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-xmark text-lg"></i>
        </button>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 text-xs bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 px-3 py-2 rounded-xl">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="font-bold">Halaman PDF:</span>
          <button onclick="changeCropModalPage(-1)" class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-white dark:bg-slate-700 border dark:border-slate-600 font-bold">-</button>
          <span id="cropModalPageNum" class="font-mono font-bold px-2">1 / 24</span>
          <button onclick="changeCropModalPage(1)" class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-white dark:bg-slate-700 border dark:border-slate-600 font-bold">+</button>
        </div>
        <span class="text-slate-500 italic">Klik & seret kotak merah pada rajah asal</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Original PDF Page Canvas Viewer for Cropping -->
      <div class="flex-1 overflow-auto bg-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-950 rounded-xl p-3 flex justify-center items-start relative">
        <div class="relative inline-block">
          <canvas id="cropModalPdfCanvas" class="shadow-lg bg-white max-w-full h-auto"></canvas>
          <div id="cropSelectionBox" class="hidden absolute border-2 border-red-600 bg-red-500/15 pointer-events-none"></div>
          <div id="cropTouchOverlay" class="absolute inset-0 cursor-crosshair"></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-center justify-end gap-2 pt-2 border-t dark:border-slate-800">
        <button onclick="closeCropAdjusterModal()" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-semibold bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
          Batal
        </button>
        <button onclick="applyCustomPdfCrop()" class="px-5 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white shadow">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-check mr-1"></i> Gunakan Keratan Asal Ini
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Custom Confirmation / Notification Modal (No native alert/confirm) -->
  <div id="customDialogModal" class="hidden fixed inset-0 z-50 bg-black/60 backdrop-blur-sm flex items-center justify-center p-4">
    <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 max-w-md w-full rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-xl flex flex-col gap-4">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <div id="dialogIconBox" class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center text-lg shrink-0">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i>
        </div>
        <h3 id="dialogTitle" class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Makluman</h3>
      </div>
      <p id="dialogMessage" class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed"></p>
      <div class="flex items-center justify-end gap-2 pt-2">
        <button id="dialogBtnCancel" onclick="closeCustomDialog()" class="hidden px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-semibold bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
          Batal
        </button>
        <button id="dialogBtnConfirm" onclick="closeCustomDialog()" class="px-5 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white">
          OK
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Formula Sheet Modal -->
  <div id="formulaModal" class="hidden fixed inset-0 z-50 bg-black/60 backdrop-blur-sm flex items-center justify-center p-4">
    <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 max-w-lg w-full rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-xl flex flex-col gap-4 max-h-[85vh] overflow-y-auto">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b pb-3 dark:border-slate-800">
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-book-bookmark text-blue-600"></i> Senarai Rumus Fizik SPM (Tekanan)
        </h3>
        <button onclick="toggleFormulaModal()" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-600 dark:hover:text-white">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-xmark text-lg"></i>
        </button>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-3 text-xs leading-relaxed">
        <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-xl">
          <div class="font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 mb-1">1. Tekanan (Pressure)</div>
          <p class="font-mono text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 font-bold">P = F / A</p>
          <p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-[11px]">F = Daya (N), A = Luas permukaan (m²). Unit: Pascal (Pa) / N m⁻²</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-xl">
          <div class="font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 mb-1">2. Tekanan Cecair (Liquid Pressure)</div>
          <p class="font-mono text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 font-bold">P = hρg &nbsp;|&nbsp; P_mutlak = P_atm + hρg</p>
          <p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-[11px]">h = kedalaman (m), ρ = ketumpatan cecair (kg m⁻³), g = 9.81 m s⁻²</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-xl">
          <div class="font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 mb-1">3. Prinsip Pascal (Sistem Hidraulik)</div>
          <p class="font-mono text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 font-bold">F₁ / A₁ = F₂ / A₂ &nbsp;|&nbsp; A₁ d₁ = A₂ d₂</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-xl">
          <div class="font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 mb-1">4. Prinsip Archimedes (Daya Apungan)</div>
          <p class="font-mono text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 font-bold">F_B = ρ V g = Berat bendalir tersesar</p>
          <p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-[11px]">Keadaan terapung pegun: Berat objek (W) = Daya apungan (F_B)</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-xl">
          <div class="font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 mb-1">5. Prinsip Bernoulli</div>
          <p class="font-mono text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 font-bold">Halaju bendalir tinggi (v ↑) ➔ Tekanan bendalir rendah (P ↓)</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Results Modal -->
  <div id="resultsModal" class="hidden fixed inset-0 z-50 bg-black/60 backdrop-blur-sm flex items-center justify-center p-4">
    <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 max-w-xl w-full rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-2xl flex flex-col gap-6 max-h-[90vh] overflow-y-auto">
      <div class="text-center space-y-1">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Slip Keputusan Kuiz Fizik</h2>
        <p id="resultStudentInfo" class="text-xs font-semibold text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400"></p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3 text-center p-4 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700">
        <div>
          <span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 font-bold block">Skor</span>
          <span id="finalScoreVal" class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-blue-600 font-mono">0/40</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 font-bold block">Peratus</span>
          <span id="finalPercentage" class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-emerald-600 font-mono">0%</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 font-bold block">Gred</span>
          <span id="finalGrade" class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-amber-500 font-mono">-</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-2">
        <h4 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400">Analisis Mengikut Subtopik</h4>
        <div id="subtopicResults" class="space-y-2 text-xs"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-center justify-end gap-2 pt-3 border-t dark:border-slate-800">
        <button onclick="closeResultsModal()" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-semibold bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200">
          Semak Jawapan
        </button>
        <button onclick="resetAndRestartExam()" class="px-5 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-semibold bg-blue-600 text-white">
          Cuba Semula
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Configure PDF.js worker
    if (window.pdfjsLib) {
      pdfjsLib.GlobalWorkerOptions.workerSrc = 'https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/pdf.js/3.11.174/pdf.worker.min.js';
    }

    /* =========================================================================
       PRE-EMBEDDED ORIGINAL IMAGES STORE (Populated when exported or extracted)
       ========================================================================= */
    window.EMBEDDED_ORIGINAL_IMAGES = window.EMBEDDED_ORIGINAL_IMAGES || {};

    /* =========================================================================
       40 QUESTIONS VERBATIM FROM TEKANAN.pdf WITH EXACT PDF PAGE & CROP BOXES
       crop: { page: 1..24, x: 0..1, y: 0..1, w: 0..1, h: 0..1 }
       All coordinates are normalized (0.0 to 1.0) relative to the original PDF page
       ========================================================================= */
    const questions = [
      {
        id: 1,
        rajahNo: "Halaman 1 • Rajah 20 / Diagram 20",
        topic: "Tekanan Cecair",
        hasDiagram: true,
        crop: { page: 1, x: 0.42, y: 0.14, w: 0.54, h: 0.36 },
        questionBM: "Rajah 20 menunjukkan sebuah tangki air yang diletakkan di ruang antara siling dan bumbung. Tangki air itu disambungkan dengan pili air dalam sebuah rumah.<br><br>Diberi:<br>• ketumpatan air, ρ = 1000 kg m⁻³<br>• pecutan graviti, g = 9.81 m s⁻²<br><br>Berapakah tekanan air pada pili air?",
        questionBI: "Diagram 20 shows a water tank placed in the space between the ceiling and the roof. The water tank is connected to a water tap in a house.<br>Given: the density of water, ρ = 1000 kg m⁻³, the gravitational acceleration, g = 9.81 m s⁻².<br>What is the water pressure at the water tap?",
        options: [
          { key: "A", bm: "29430 Pa", bi: "" },
          { key: "B", bm: "39420 Pa", bi: "" },
          { key: "C", bm: "49050 Pa", bi: "" },
          { key: "D", bm: "58860 Pa", bi: "" }
        ],
        answer: "C",
        explanation: "<b>Kaedah Penyelesaian:</b><br>Kedalaman turus air pada pili air, <i>h</i> = 6 m − 1 m = 5 m.<br>Tekanan air, <b>P = hρg</b> = 5 × 1000 × 9.81 = <b>49 050 Pa</b>."
      },
      {
        id: 2,
        rajahNo: "Halaman 1 • Soalan 2",
        topic: "Tekanan Gas & Atmosfera",
        hasDiagram: false,
        crop: null,
        questionBM: "Apakah maksud tekanan atmosfera?",
        questionBI: "What is meant by atmospheric pressure?",
        options: [
          { key: "A", bm: "Daya per unit luas", bi: "Force per unit area" },
          { key: "B", bm: "Perbezaan tekanan antara altitud tinggi dan rendah", bi: "Pressure difference between high and low altitude" },
          { key: "C", bm: "Tekanan yang disebabkan oleh perlanggaran antara zarah-zarah gas dan dinding", bi: "The pressure caused by the collision between the gas particles and the walls" },
          { key: "D", bm: "Tekanan yang disebabkan oleh berat lapisan udara yang bertindak ke atas permukaan bumi", bi: "The pressure caused by the weight of the air layer acting on the Earth's surface" }
        ],
        answer: "D",
        explanation: "<b>Penjelasan:</b><br>Tekanan atmosfera ialah tekanan yang disebabkan oleh <b>berat lapisan udara yang bertindak ke atas permukaan bumi</b>."
      },
      {
        id: 3,
        rajahNo: "Halaman 2 • Rajah 21 / Diagram 21",
        topic: "Tekanan Gas & Atmosfera",
        hasDiagram: true,
        crop: { page: 2, x: 0.14, y: 0.08, w: 0.76, h: 0.31 },
        questionBM: "Rajah 21 menunjukkan sebuah manometer yang disambungkan kepada bekalan gas.<br>Apakah yang akan berlaku kepada ketinggian, <i>h</i> antara aras cecair di dalam kedua-dua lengan manometer jika air digantikan dengan merkuri?",
        questionBI: "Diagram 21 shows a manometer connected to a gas supply.<br>What will happen to the height, h between the liquid levels in both arms of the manometer if water is replaced by mercury?",
        options: [
          { key: "A", bm: "Sifar", bi: "Zero" },
          { key: "B", bm: "Berkurang", bi: "Decreases" },
          { key: "C", bm: "Bertambah", bi: "Increases" },
          { key: "D", bm: "Tidak berubah", bi: "Unchanged" }
        ],
        answer: "B",
        explanation: "<b>Penjelasan:</b><br>Daripada hubungan ΔP = hρg, ketinggian turus cecair <i>h</i> berkadar songsang dengan ketumpatan cecair ρ. Oleh sebab merkuri jauh lebih tumpat daripada air, ketinggian <i>h</i> akan <b>berkurang (decreases)</b>."
      },
      {
        id: 4,
        rajahNo: "Halaman 2–3 • Rajah 22 / Diagram 22",
        topic: "Prinsip Archimedes",
        hasDiagram: true,
        crop: { page: 2, x: 0.12, y: 0.68, w: 0.76, h: 0.27 },
        questionBM: "Rajah 22 menunjukkan sebiji epal terapung di permukaan air.<br>Mengapakah epal itu terapung?",
        questionBI: "Diagram 22 shows an apple floats at the surface of water.<br>Why does the apple float?",
        options: [
          { key: "A", bm: "Berat epal = Daya apungan", bi: "Weight of apple = Buoyant force" },
          { key: "B", bm: "Daya paduan bertindak ke arah atas", bi: "Resultant force acts upward" },
          { key: "C", bm: "Daya apungan lebih besar daripada berat epal", bi: "The buoyant force is greater than the weight of apple" },
          { key: "D", bm: "Isipadu epal = isipadu air yang disesarkan", bi: "Volume of apple = volume of water displaced" }
        ],
        answer: "A",
        explanation: "<b>Penjelasan:</b><br>Apabila objek terapung pegun di permukaan air, daya-daya berada dalam keseimbangan: <b>Berat epal = Daya apungan</b> (daya paduan = 0)."
      },
      {
        id: 5,
        rajahNo: "Halaman 3 • Soalan 5",
        topic: "Prinsip Bernoulli",
        hasDiagram: false,
        crop: null,
        questionBM: "Sebuah kereta lumba dilengkapi dengan spoiler berbentuk aerofoil.<br>Prinsip fizik manakah yang menerangkan fungsi spoiler tersebut?",
        questionBI: "A racing car is equipped with an aerofoil-shaped spoiler.<br>Which physics principle explains the spoiler's function?",
        options: [
          { key: "A", bm: "Prinsip Pascal", bi: "Pascal's principle" },
          { key: "B", bm: "Prinsip Bernoulli", bi: "Bernoulli's principle" },
          { key: "C", bm: "Prinsip Archimedes", bi: "Archimedes' principle" },
          { key: "D", bm: "Prinsip Keabadian Momentum", bi: "Principle of Conservation of Momentum" }
        ],
        answer: "B",
        explanation: "<b>Penjelasan:</b><br>Spoiler berbentuk aerofoil terbalik berfungsi menggunakan <b>Prinsip Bernoulli</b> untuk menghasilkan perbezaan tekanan udara yang menjana daya ke bawah (downforce)."
      },
      {
        id: 6,
        rajahNo: "Halaman 3–4 • Rajah 16 / Diagram 16",
        topic: "Tekanan Gas & Atmosfera",
        hasDiagram: true,
        crop: { page: 3, x: 0.14, y: 0.56, w: 0.78, h: 0.39 },
        questionBM: "Rajah 16 menunjukkan keratan rentas sebuah tingkap sebuah kapal terbang yang sedang terbang pada altitud yang tinggi.<br>Antara penyataan berikut, yang manakah betul?",
        questionBI: "Diagram 16 shows a cross-section of a window of an airplane flying at high altitude.<br>Which of the following statements is correct?",
        options: [
          { key: "A", bm: "Tekanan udara di dalam kabin hampir sama dengan tekanan pada aras laut.", bi: "The air pressure in the cabin is almost the same as the pressure at sea level." },
          { key: "B", bm: "Tekanan atmosfera di luar kabin = Tekanan udara di dalam kabin.", bi: "The atmospheric pressure outside the cabin = The air pressure inside the cabin." },
          { key: "C", bm: "Tekanan atmosfera di luar kabin bertambah apabila altitud bertambah.", bi: "The atmospheric pressure outside the cabin increases as the altitude increases." },
          { key: "D", bm: "Tekanan udara di dalam kabin berkurang apabila altitud berkurang.", bi: "The air pressure in the cabin decreases as the altitude decreases." }
        ],
        answer: "A",
        explanation: "<b>Penjelasan:</b><br>Kabin kapal terbang dimampatkan supaya <b>tekanan udara di dalam kabin hampir sama dengan tekanan atmosfera pada aras laut</b> demi keselesaan dan keselamatan penumpang."
      },
      {
        id: 7,
        rajahNo: "Halaman 4 • Soalan 7",
        topic: "Tekanan Gas & Atmosfera",
        hasDiagram: false,
        crop: null,
        questionBM: "Tekanan gas dalam bekas adalah disebabkan oleh perlanggaran molekul-molekul gas dengan dinding bekas. Perubahan manakah yang akan mengurangkan tekanan gas?",
        questionBI: "The gas pressure in a container is due to the collision of the gas molecules with the container's wall. Which change will decrease the gas pressure?",
        options: [
          { key: "A", bm: "Meningkatkan suhu gas.", bi: "Increase the gas temperature." },
          { key: "B", bm: "Meningkatkan jisim bekas.", bi: "Increase the mass of container." },
          { key: "C", bm: "Mengurangkan isi padu bekas.", bi: "Decrease the volume of container." },
          { key: "D", bm: "Mengurangkan halaju purata molekul-molekul gas.", bi: "Decrease the average velocity of gas molecules." }
        ],
        answer: "D",
        explanation: "<b>Penjelasan:</b><br><b>Mengurangkan halaju purata molekul-molekul gas</b> akan mengurangkan kadar perlanggaran dan kadar perubahan momentum molekul pada dinding bekas, seterusnya mengurangkan tekanan gas."
      },
      {
        id: 8,
        rajahNo: "Halaman 4–5 • Rajah 17 / Diagram 17",
        topic: "Prinsip Pascal",
        hasDiagram: true,
        crop: { page: 4, x: 0.16, y: 0.56, w: 0.72, h: 0.39 },
        questionBM: "Rajah 17 menunjukkan sebuah kerusi tukang gunting yang terletak di sebuah kedai gunting rambut. Kerusi tersebut menggunakan sistem hidraulik.<br>Luas keratan rentas omboh besar dan omboh kecil masing-masing adalah 90 cm² dan 15 cm². Jisim kerusi ialah 70 kg.<br>Hitungkan daya yang perlu dikenakan kepada omboh kecil untuk mengangkat seorang lelaki berjisim 75 kg.",
        questionBI: "Diagram 17 shows a barber's chair located in a barber shop. The chair uses a hydraulic system.<br>The cross sectional area of the big piston and the small piston are 90 cm² and 15 cm² respectively. The mass of the chair is 70 kg.<br>Calculate the force exerted on the small piston to lift up a man of mass 75 kg.",
        options: [
          { key: "A", bm: "122.63 N", bi: "" },
          { key: "B", bm: "237.08 N", bi: "" },
          { key: "C", bm: "241.67 N", bi: "" },
          { key: "D", bm: "853.47 N", bi: "" }
        ],
        answer: "B",
        explanation: "<b>Kaedah Penyelesaian:</b><br>Jumlah jisim beban pada omboh besar = 70 kg + 75 kg = 145 kg.<br>Berat beban, F₂ = mg = 145 × 9.81 = 1422.45 N.<br>Ikut Prinsip Pascal: <b>F₁ / A₁ = F₂ / A₂</b><br>F₁ = (15 / 90) × 1422.45 = <b>237.08 N</b>."
      },
      {
        id: 9,
        rajahNo: "Halaman 5 • Soalan 9",
        topic: "Prinsip Archimedes",
        hasDiagram: false,
        crop: null,
        questionBM: "Antara penyataan berikut, manakah yang berkaitan dengan prinsip Archimedes?",
        questionBI: "Which of the following statements is related to Archimedes' principle?",
        options: [
          { key: "A", bm: "Daya tujah ke atas = jisim bendalir disesarkan", bi: "Upthrust = mass of fluid displaced" },
          { key: "B", bm: "Daya tujah ke atas = berat bendalir disesarkan", bi: "Upthrust = weight of fluid displaced" },
          { key: "C", bm: "Daya tujah ke atas = isipadu bendalir disesarkan", bi: "Upthrust = volume of fluid displaced" },
          { key: "D", bm: "Daya tujah ke atas = ketumpatan bendalir disesarkan", bi: "Upthrust = density of fluid displaced" }
        ],
        answer: "B",
        explanation: "<b>Penjelasan:</b><br>Prinsip Archimedes menyatakan bahawa <b>daya tujah ke atas (daya apungan) = berat bendalir yang disesarkan</b>."
      },
      {
        id: 10,
        rajahNo: "Halaman 5–6 • Rajah 18 / Diagram 18",
        topic: "Prinsip Bernoulli",
        hasDiagram: true,
        crop: { page: 5, x: 0.14, y: 0.50, w: 0.76, h: 0.46 },
        questionBM: "Rajah 18 menunjukkan bumbung sebuah rumah terangkat semasa ribut taufan.<br>Antara penyataan berikut yang manakah betul untuk menerangkan fenomena itu?",
        questionBI: "Diagram 18 shows the roof of a house being lifted during a storm.<br>Which of the following statement is correct to explain the phenomenon?",
        options: [
          { key: "A", bm: "Laju udara di X lebih rendah menyebabkan tekanan udara lebih rendah.", bi: "Speed of air at X is lower causing lower air pressure." },
          { key: "B", bm: "Laju udara di X lebih tinggi menyebabkan tekanan udara lebih tinggi.", bi: "Speed of air at X is higher causing higher air pressure." },
          { key: "C", bm: "Laju udara di W lebih tinggi menyebabkan tekanan udara lebih rendah.", bi: "Speed of air at W is higher causing lower air pressure." },
          { key: "D", bm: "Laju udara di W lebih rendah menyebabkan tekanan udara lebih rendah.", bi: "Speed of air at W is lower causing lower air pressure." }
        ],
        answer: "C",
        explanation: "<b>Penjelasan:</b><br>Mengikut Prinsip Bernoulli, <b>laju udara yang tinggi di bahagian atas bumbung (W) menyebabkan tekanan udara yang lebih rendah</b> berbanding tekanan udara di dalam rumah (X), lalu menghasilkan daya angkat."
      },
      {
        id: 11,
        rajahNo: "Halaman 6 • Rajah 15 / Diagram 15",
        topic: "Tekanan Cecair",
        hasDiagram: true,
        crop: { page: 6, x: 0.14, y: 0.36, w: 0.78, h: 0.38 },
        questionBM: "Rajah 15 menunjukkan tiga bekas serupa disambung kepada tiga biji belon kempis yang serupa P, Q dan R oleh satu tiub berklip. Bekas itu diisi dengan air pada ketinggian yang berbeza.<br>Apabila klip dibuka, belon yang manakah mengembang paling pantas?",
        questionBI: "Diagram 15 shows three similar containers connected with three similar flat balloons P, Q and R by a tube with a clip. The containers were filled with water at different heights.<br>When the clip opens, which balloon expands faster?",
        options: [
          { key: "A", bm: "P", bi: "" },
          { key: "B", bm: "Q", bi: "" },
          { key: "C", bm: "R", bi: "" },
          { key: "D", bm: "P, Q dan R mengembang serentak.", bi: "P, Q and R expand simultaneously." }
